    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What a version covers",
      "items": [
        "Inline prompt template + CLAUDE.md + sub-agent .md + skills, hashed from the tag's tree",
        "Inputs outside the repo (target repo, proposal) are pinned per execution, not hashed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Why it exists",
      "items": [
        "The shepherd sat pinned at 1.25.0 for three weeks while the repo shipped 1.33.0",
        "Editing a sub-agent file must not silently change behaviour without a bump"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Fail closed",
      "items": [
        "A missing release fails the dev loop non-retryably — no baked-in default",
